>   Squeaky board traps are disarmable with a potion of oil. 
> 
Squeaky boards may be disarmed with oil or grease. Webs may also be removed 
with #untrap. Pits, holes and trap doors are disarmable with a boulder. 

Level teleport and polymorph traps are disarmable by using them.

Rolling boulder traps cannot be disarmed except by triggering them when 
there is no suitable boulder, but they may be rendered harmless easily 
enough by pushing the boulder out of the way.


